				},
				{
					"id": 740841102,
					"content": "Kok ada Melusine di sini? Hei! Cepat menjauh dari Vishap itu, bahaya!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841103,
					"content": "Melusine yang muncul secara tiba-tiba itu mengulurkan tangannya dan mengelus kepala Vishap tersebut, dan Vishap yang marah itu kemudian menundukkan tubuhnya dengan lembut.\\nDia membuka mulutnya, memuntahkan tetesan air sejernih kristal, lalu berbalik dan melompat ke dalam air.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841104,
					"content": "Eh? Apa yang terjadi?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841105,
					"content": "Kunci.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841106,
					"content": "Hah ... kunci apaan? Tetesan air ini itu kunci?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841107,
					"content": "Pahsiv.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841108,
					"content": "Hmm ... Tetesan air ini Pahsiv?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841109,
					"content": "Melusine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841110,
					"content": "Haduh! Apa sih maksudnya? Tetesan air ini Melusine? Pusing deh kepala Paimon. Apa-apaan ini? Bukannya kamu Melusine?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841111,
					"content": "Pahsiv ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841112,
					"content": "Uh ... kamu Pahsiv? Atau nama kamu Pahsiv? Eh, bentar. Enggak jadi deh, Paimon bakal makin bingung nih kayaknya kalau dijawab ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841113,
					"content": "Pokoknya Paimon panggil kamu Pahsiv. Oke?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841114,
					"content": "Melusine ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841115,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME} ... gimana nih? Paimon sama sekali enggak ngerti deh dia sebenarnya mau ngomong apa ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841116,
					"content": "Kamu bisa mengerti ucapan kami, kan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841117,
					"content": "Pahsiv ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841118,
					"content": "Tetesan air ini adalah kunci, kan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841119,
					"content": "Pahsiv.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841120,
					"content": "Kamu bukan manusia, kan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841121,
					"content": "Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841122,
					"content": "Ugh ... kayaknya enggak baik juga deh kalau kita ngomelin dia ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841123,
					"content": "Aku bukan manusia, kan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841124,
					"content": "Me-Melusine?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841125,
					"content": "Ah! Tunggu dulu! Kayaknya Paimon mulai nangkep. Pahsiv itu artinya \"iya\", Melusine itu artinya \"bukan\". Gitu kan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841126,
					"content": "Pahsiv! Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820737,
					"content": "Pahsiv! Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820738
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841127,
					"content": "Jadi nama kamu bukan Pahsiv. Maaf ya, Paimon salah.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841128,
					"content": "Pahsiv ... suka.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841129,
					"content": "Kamu suka nama ini?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841130
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841130,
					"content": "Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841131,
					"content": "#Mantap deh! Kalau gitu, Paimon panggil kamu pakai nama itu ya, hehe. Nama Paimon ya Paimon, ini {NICKNAME}. Senang deh kenalan sama kamu. Terima kasih ya tadi sudah ngebantu kami menyingkirkan Vishap-nya.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841132,
					"content": "Si biru, baik, kunci, dilindungi.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841133,
					"content": "Si biru itu maksudnya Vishap yang barusan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841134,
					"content": "Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841135,
					"content": "Jangan-jangan dia bantu kamu lindungi kuncinya? Kamu sama Vishap itu berteman?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841136,
					"content": "Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841137,
					"content": "Si ungu, curi kunci ... si biru, pingsan ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841138,
					"content": "Si ungu? Siapa tuh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841139,
					"content": "#Si ungu, jahat! Si biru, Paimon, {NICKNAME}, baik!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841140,
					"content": "Hmm ... okelah. Walaupun kedengarannya kamu kayak lagi muji-muji kita, tapi rasanya agak aneh gimana gitu ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841141,
					"content": "Si ungu, jahat sekali, Erinnyes, Melusine ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841142,
					"content": "Erinnyes Melusine? Eh ... Erinnyes enggak?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841143
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841143,
					"content": "Erinnyes sedang gawat?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841144
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841144,
					"content": "Erinnyes, Melusine, sekarang ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841145,
					"content": "Pahsiv, Erinnyes, lindungi ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841146,
					"content": "Jadi, sesuatu yang buruk terjadi pada Erinnyes, terus kamu mau melindunginya?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841147
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841147,
					"content": "#Paimon, {NICKNAME}, Erinnyes, buagh, bugh ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841148
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841148,
					"content": "#Hah ... buagh, bugh? Eh ... kamu mau Paimon sama {NICKNAME} hajar Erinnyes?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841149
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841149,
					"content": "Melusine!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841150
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841150,
					"content": "Maksudnya, kamu mau kami bantu?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841151
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841151,
					"content": "Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841152
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841152,
					"content": "OOH! Ternyata bantu ya, untunglah. Tapi kayaknya agak susah sih kalau mau kami bantu hajar Erinnyes sebesar itu....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841153
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841153,
					"content": "BUAGH! BUGH!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841154,
						740841158
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841154,
					"content": "Ada imbalan enggak nih?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841155
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841158,
					"content": "Terus kita harus bantuin gimana?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841159
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841155,
					"content": "Im ... balan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841156
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841156,
					"content": "#Haduh, {NICKNAME}, Pahsiv susah komunikasi gini, kayaknya dia enggak bakal nemuin orang lain yang bisa bantu. Kita saja, ya? Ya?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841157
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841157,
					"content": "Terus kita harus bantuin gimana?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841159
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841159,
					"content": "Kunci, kunci, kunci, jumlah.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841160
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841160,
					"content": "Terus? Kuncinya ada berapa?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841161
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841161,
					"content": "Kunci! Kunci! Kunci!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841162
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841162,
					"content": "Tiga kunci?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841163
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841163,
					"content": "Pahsiv! Kunci, jalan kabut, selatan ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841164
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841164,
					"content": "Kunci, mata air, utara ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841165
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841165,
					"content": "Kunci, dedalu, timur ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841166
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841166,
					"content": "Oh, jadi gitu ya ... Kalau gitu, Paimon catat dulu ... total ada tiga kunci: jalan berkabut di selatan, mata air di utara, pohon dedalu di timur ... gitu kan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841167
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841167,
					"content": "Kunci, kunci, kunci, alun-alun, barat.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841168
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841168,
					"content": "Di alun-alun barat masih ada tiga kunci lagi?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841169
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841169,
					"content": "Kumpulin tiga kunci lalu pergi ke alun-alun?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841170
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841170,
					"content": "#Paimon, Melusine! {NICKNAME}, Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841171
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841171,
					"content": "#Capek deh, Pahsiv. Kamu jangan bikin Paimon jadi kelihatan beda jauh dong pintarnya sama {NICKNAME}! Kami tuh kurang lebih sama kok pintarnya!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841172
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841172,
					"content": "Kembali lagi deh, intinya sekarang kan kita sudah punya satu kunci, kelihatannya tinggal cari dua lagi sisanya terus beres deh.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841173
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841173,
					"content": "Erinnyes, Melusine ... Pahsiv, melindungi!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841174
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841174,
					"content": "Tenang saja, kami mungkin enggak terlalu paham apa yang terjadi, tapi kami pasti bakal bantu kamu lindungi Erinnyes kok.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841175
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841175,
					"content": "Tapi Paimon jelasin sedikit deh, Pahsiv. Kalau kamu kebetulan lihat benda berwarna kuning keemasan dan bundar-bundar yang enggak diincar sama siapa pun, atau mungkin kotak yang kelihatannya mahal banget ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841176
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841176,
					"content": "Kalau bisa, kamu langsung kasih tahu kami ya!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841177
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841177,
					"content": "Pahsiv menyentuh kepalanya seperti kebingungan, kemudian melompat dua kali dengan gembira, lalu buru-buru pergi.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841178
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841178,
					"content": "#Ah, langsung pergi saja dia. Kayaknya ini urusan yang mendesak banget deh. {NICKNAME}, yuk kita cari dua kunci lainnya.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
